        "detailed_description": "<h1>Baccarat</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3590620/extras/e3129988be52e6157e6de9c45035e969.avif?t=1788972485\" width=600 height=190 /></span></p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Baccarat keeps you on the edge of your seat with every turn of the cards! Feel the thrill of high-stakes decisions, the rush of a perfect hand, and the sweet satisfaction of a big win. Will luck be on your side, or will the suspense keep you coming back for more?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3590620/extras/119bb6831fb5a2d3c22e994cb7d19d7a.poster.avif?t=1788972485\" width=600 height=334 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3590620/extras/119bb6831fb5a2d3c22e994cb7d19d7a.webm?t=1788972485\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3590620/extras/119bb6831fb5a2d3c22e994cb7d19d7a.mp4?t=1788972485\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >About Baccarat</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Baccarat immerses you in the thrilling world of high-stakes card play, where strategy and luck determine the outcome of every hand. The objective is to bet on whether the Player or Banker will have a hand closest to nine or take a risk by wagering on a Tie. Each round follows traditional Baccarat rules, with two cards dealt to both the Player and Banker, and additional cards drawn based on fixed drawing rules.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/